From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 06:25:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] camera: Noise reduction and exposure for cameras of
 camera-hal-bridge

camera-hal-bridge now shoots through Camera2, which brings MediaTek's
multi-frame noise reduction to photos and a working exposure compensation.
The scene button's menu gets a switch for the noise reduction, on by default
(the HAL then decides when several frames help), since it takes longer and
softens fine detail, and an exposure section from -2 to +2 EV. Both are kept
in the settings and go to the bridge with the others.
---
